WRITE_SENSOR_DETECT
Title Pickup, Full Size, Dual Tires, Pintle <Vehicle Configurations>
CATEGORY Vehicle Configurations 
DATASET_TITLE Pickup, Full Size, Dual Tires, Pintle
#RingCtrl8 1
NUM_CACHED_RUNS 1
#RingCtrl9 

